# Mapping: expected_manifest_sha256; explicit env-file overrides operation JSON on each invocation.
# Secret handling: reference/digest/public policy only; private key/DSN bytes remain in original protected scope.
# Effect: frozen at upgrade intent; later changes refuse; no application rebuild; changed reader policy requires new runtime generation.
PROJECT_ONE_OFFLINE_CUMULATIVE_UPGRADE_MANIFEST_SHA256=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa

